DEPRECATION WARNING: config/settings.yml needs these changes before GeoBlacklight 6: delete the icon attribute from RELATIONSHIPS_SHOWN, because GeoBlacklight 6 labels related records with a resource class badge instead and only warns, once a boot, that the key is dead; remove Settings.DOWNLOAD_FORMATS, because GeoBlacklight 6 removes the generated download subsystem and never reads it. Note the 4.x upgrade added this key because GeoBlacklight 5 required it; remove Settings.HELP_TEXT, because GeoBlacklight 6 removes the viewer help text popovers along with ViewerHelpTextComponent and no longer reads the key at all; remove Settings.ICON_MAPPING, because GeoBlacklight 6 drops the lookup from its geoblacklight_icon helper and removes the institution icon components this maps onto, so a provider named here renders as an empty span; remove Settings.LEAFLET, because GeoBlacklight 6 replaces the leaflet and openlayers viewers with <ogm-viewer> and reads none of this section — including the BASEMAPS key 5.3 added for CARTO API keys, which becomes light_basemap_url and dark_basemap_url on Geoblacklight.configuration, each the URL of a MapLibre style document; remove Settings.SIDEBAR_STATIC_MAP, because GeoBlacklight 6's StaticMapComponent decides for itself, from whether the record is previewable and georeferenced, and never reads this list of viewer protocols; remove Settings.TIMEOUT_DOWNLOAD, because GeoBlacklight 6 removes the generated download subsystem and never reads it; rename the 27 uppercase top level keys to lowercase, because GeoBlacklight 6 resolves settings case-insensitively and warns once per uppercase key it has to fall back to; convert the Settings.UPPERCASE reads in app/controllers/catalog_controller.rb and app/models/solr_document.rb in the same pass, or the application will not boot (called from <main> at /Users/peter.j.speltz/peter/sfei/SFEI-GeoBlacklight-Internal/config/environment.rb:5)
